.TH SLIPFORK-LSP 1 "2026-11-21" "slipfork 0.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
slipfork-lsp \- language server for Slipfork Forkfiles
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B slipfork-lsp
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B slipfork-lsp
speaks the Language Server Protocol over stdio and edits Forkfiles: diagnostics,
completion, hover for keys and service fields, and formatting.
It never touches Btrfs, \fBcrun\fR, or the network, so it runs on Linux, macOS,
and Windows; \fIslipfork\fR itself runs only on Linux.
Editors launch it through the Zed extension or any LSP client.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR slipfork (1)
